&lt;p&gt;What style of lettering is this? The super-elongated, overly ornamented letterforms that intertwine with each other are so beautiful. I would love to learn more about it but have no information - anything would be appreciated.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ID Fonts @ Win</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/120811/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2014 04:49:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/120811/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Dear Friend,&lt;br&gt;
