I need to find this font, please help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I only have a sample in Greek though: &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150427052927/http:/i781.photobucket.com/albums/yy95/f1spa/Miscellaneous/01_zps8f913ef1.png" title="http://i781.photobucket.com/albums/yy95/f1spa/Miscellaneous/01_zps8f913ef1.png"&gt;http://i781.photobucket.com/albums/yy95/f1spa/Miscellaneous/01_zps8f913e&amp;hellip;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Please help identify this beautiful calligraphic font(s)</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/102152/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2013 11:43:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/102152/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m looking to identify both of the fonts used on these cards. One is a script, the other is Gothic. I realize that these might be hand calligraphy, but if anyone could point me to reasonable look-a-like fonts, I&amp;rsquo;d be thriled!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!&lt;/p&gt;
